h_text","block_id":"=c3"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"0804cc1d-b316-49f5-9abf-29d4e36197d3","type":"message","user":"UL5G6QL5U","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/cocopon/iceberg.vim|iceberg.vim\u003eと\u003chttps://github.com/rhysd/vim-color-spring-night|vim-color-spring-night\u003eは結構好きかもしれないです。","ts":"1636031552.102800","thread_ts":"1636031552.102800","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NAJ"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"b7c21841-353b-4689-8334-5a9bb4a0fc05","type":"message","user":"U01QQUS1TJ5","text":"おはようございます。vim スクリプトをデバッグするときは良い方法がありますか？私は\"ryGして。:debug \u003c@UC88A77P0\u003e 行う。もっと良い方法はありますか？","ts":"1636055505.133300","thread_ts":"1636055505.133300","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nr0IB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b3fb7db0-a75b-4a73-b2d3-3e919bf5450e","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"ちなみに私は、外部ファイルに変更があったときはいつでも※勝手にバッファが書き換わるようにしています。\u003chttps://github.com/TonalidadeHidrica/dotfiles/blob/master/.config/nvim/init.vim#L312-L325|私の dotfiles\u003e もご参照ください。これで外部コマンドで `cargo fmt` をかけても安心です。\n\n※ただし、未保存の変更があったときは警告が出ます","ts":"1636047935.128000","thread_ts":"1636022135.061400","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/TonalidadeHidrica/dotfiles/blob/master/.config/nvim/init.vim | init.vim\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/TonalidadeHidrica/dotfiles/blob/master/.config/nvim/init.vim | init.vim\u003e","text":"```\n\" vvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvv\n\" Automatic reload from disk\n\n\" Triger `autoread` when files changes on disk\n\" \u003chttps://unix.stackexchange.com/questions/149209/refresh-changed-content-of-file-opened-in-vim/383044#383044\u003e\n\" \u003chttps://vi.stackexchange.com/questions/13692/prevent-focusgained-autocmd-running-in-command-line-editing-mode\u003e\n    autocmd FocusGained,BufEnter,CursorHold,CursorHoldI *\n            \\ if mode() !~ '\\v(c|r.?|!|t)' \u0026amp;\u0026amp; getcmdwintype() == '' | checktime | endif\n\n\" Notification after file change\n\" \u003chttps://vi.stackexchange.com/questions/13091/autocmd-event-for-autoread\u003e\nautocmd FileChangedShellPost *\n  \\ echohl WarningMsg | echo \"File changed on disk. Buffer reloaded.\" | echohl None\n\" ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/TonalidadeHidrica/dotfiles|TonalidadeHidrica/dotfiles\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png"}],"subtype":"thread_broadcast","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U011WJ8K6UU"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=PlVH"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"f3ae3d58-cfac-49b6-80ad-4b70f2ce0208","type":"message","user":"UM35JU8KC","text":"こんばんは。Rust, Goなどを書いているときに\n1. よしできた、コンパイルするか\n2. ついでにコードフォーマッタもかけとこう\n3. おや、コンパイルエラーになった。ここをこう直せばいいか。ファイルを保存して、再度コンパイルを…\n4. *警告: 読込んだ後にファイルに変更がありました!!!* 本当に上書きしますか (y/n)?\nというのを頻繁にやってしまうのですが、みなさんはどうやって回避されているのでしょうか。","ts":"1636022135.061400","thread_ts":"1636022135.061400","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kPHv"}]}}]
